## Description

This PR updates the **IMAC Jenkins Jobs Audit** process to automatically generate a CSV file containing all Jenkins pipelines cataloged by project.

The audit script now creates `jenkins_pipeline_catalog.csv` in the Jenkins workspace with pipeline and compliance information.

The Jenkins audit pipeline has also been updated to use `archiveArtifacts` to archive the generated CSV after a successful audit run. This makes the CSV available for download directly from the corresponding Jenkins build.

### Changes
- Added CSV generation to `audit_jenkins_jobs.py`.
- Catalogs Jenkins pipelines by project.
- Includes pipeline path and compliance status in the CSV.
- Generates `jenkins_pipeline_catalog.csv` in the Jenkins workspace.
- Added `archiveArtifacts` to `Jenkinsfile.audit`.
- Archives the generated CSV per successful Jenkins audit run.

### Acceptance Criteria
- CSV file is automatically generated during the Jenkins Jobs Audit.
- CSV file is archived and available from the Jenkins build artifacts.
